The full licence text is in native/LICENSE. The companion links JUCE under
JUCE's AGPLv3 licence option; third-party components and their licences are
listed in native/companion-release/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt.

The complete corresponding source for any released companion binary is this
repository at the release tag named in the zip file name:
https://github.com/LILSYNNOFFICIAL/SYN-MASTER (tags: v*).

